.el .ds Aq '
.TH artifacts 1  "artifacts " 
.SH NAME
artifacts \- Evaluate artifact accountability baselines
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBartifacts\fR [\fB\-\-stale\fR] [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIARTIFACT_ID\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Evaluate artifact accountability baselines
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH INSPECTION
.TP
\fB\-\-stale\fR
Filter accountability report to display only STALE artifacts
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact status table layout
.TP
[\fIARTIFACT_ID\fR]
Optional artifact element ID (UUID or prefix) for detailed inspection
